### 1. Authenticate & Obtain JWT Token (Port 8084)
POST http://localhost:8084/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

> {%
    // Automatically store the JWT Token into global variable 'auth_token'
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.jwtToken);
%}

###

### 2. Submit Component Return Processing Request (Port 8081 - Integral Hardware)
POST http://localhost:8081/service
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "john_doe",
  "contactNumber": 9876543210,
  "creditCardNumber": 4532890123456789,
  "componentType": "Integral",
  "componentName": "MacBook Pro M3 Display Assembly",
  "quantityOfDefective": 1,
  "isPriorityRequest": true
}

###

### 3. Submit Accessory Return Processing Request (Port 8081 - Standard Cable)
POST http://localhost:8081/service
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "sarah_connor",
  "contactNumber": 9823019283,
  "creditCardNumber": 5412759081234567,
  "componentType": "Accessory",
  "componentName": "Sony WH-1000XM5 USB-C Charging Cable",
  "quantityOfDefective": 2,
  "isPriorityRequest": false
}

###

### 4. Execute Payment for Return Order Charges (Port 8081)
# Parameters: /payment/{requestID}/{creditCardNumber}/{creditLimit}/{processingCharge}
POST http://localhost:8081/payment/1/4532890123456789/50000/700
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###